// Lila Voss, a regular of the Lull: a table for one, every evening. SQ-08 "Table for One": bring her the diary she kept and a glass of clear water.
npc: lila_voss
name: Lila Voss
start: done [flag:sq_08_done]
start: diary [flag:sq_08_started, item:lila_diary]
start: back [flag:met_lila]
start: first

node: first
  on_enter: {flag:met_lila, flag:sq_08_started}
  lila_voss (dreamy): "A table for one. It is always a table for one, is it not? I come every evening and I order the amber one, and it is lovely."
  lila_voss (dreamy): "I am sure I came for a reason. Isn't it wonderful not to remember it?"
  > "What did you do before?" -> job
  > "What did you come for?" -> reason
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: back
  lila_voss (dreamy): "Oh. Hello. Do I know you? Sit, sit. The amber one is lovely."
  > "What did you come for?" -> reason
  > "What did you do before?" -> job
  > "Who is the woman at the window table?" -> marta
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: job
  lila_voss (vague): "Records, I think. The Auditors' archive, something with a great many shelves. I used to write things down so I would not lose them. Silly."
  > "What did you come for?" -> reason
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: reason
  lila_voss (vague): "I had it written down. I wrote everything down. A little black notebook with a green ribbon. I cannot think where I put it. Somebody sensible must have put it somewhere sensible."
  lila_voss (vague): "The staff look after lost things, I believe. Not that anything is lost here."
  > "I will see if I can find it." -> goodbye
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: marta
  lila_voss (vague): "Marta? By the window. She writes a card to her brother every month, the same card, and I think she has never once been unhappy. I envy her. Or I would, if I envied anything."
  > "Thank you." -> back

node: diary
  lila_voss (startled): "That is... that is mine. The ribbon. Where did you find it?"
  > [item:clear_water] "Drink this first. Not the amber. Then read." -> wake
  > [!item:clear_water] "Read it." -> tryread
  > "Keep it safe for now." -> goodbye

node: tryread
  lila_voss (struggling): "It is very sweet. Somebody has the most careful handwriting. It says: do not drink the amber one. I do not understand why not. I cannot hold it, I think the drink is in the way. Is there anything else I could have? Anything at all."
  > "I will find you something." -> goodbye

node: wake
  on_enter: {-item:clear_water, -item:lila_diary, flag:sq_08_done, flag:lila_awake, +clue:lull_dulling(lila_voss), +clue:odile_signatory(lila_voss)}
  lila_voss (struggling): "It is plain. It tastes of nothing. And it is... oh."
  lila_voss (clear): "I had a daughter. I came here the first time to forget her and I have been forgetting everything since. Four years. Four years I have sat at this table."
  lila_voss (clear): "Listen. The amber is how the Host keeps the regulars. You will lose your own memory of things too, if you stay: yesterday goes first. Write it down, as I did, and then leave and sleep somewhere else, and it comes back."
  lila_voss (clear): "Marta by the window, she writes her brother the same card every month. And the Councillor in the corner booth, Odile Marchetti, she was on the council once. She has not finished a drink in years. Someone should wake her. Not me: I am not ready to be seen."
  > "Thank you, Lila." -> done

node: done
  lila_voss (clear): "I will sit here a little longer, and pretend. If I leave all at once, he will notice. Water, for you? No, I will pay. It seems to be what I am for."
  > "The corner booth." -> booth
  > "Goodbye." -> goodbye

node: booth
  lila_voss (clear): "Odile. Under the chandelier. Be gentle. She will tell you she is happy, and she will not be lying."
  > "Thank you." -> done

node: goodbye
  lila_voss (dreamy): "Come back, if you like. I will be here. I am always here."
  end
